        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-3/4\" Large Classic Shower Door Knob</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful 1-3/4\" diameter classic style glass shower door knob is easy to grab because of its large size and it compliments the traditional designed bathroom. Single knob kits are normally used on sliding glass shower doors but can also be used on one side of a swing glass door. They have a matching finish screw cover for a clean looking installation.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SD-CLASSIC1-size.gif?v=1704354505\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Classic Shower Door Knob Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/classic-shower-door-knob-pair-sd-classic2\"><b>Classic Shower Door Knob Pair</b></a> and matching <a href=\"/products/classic-cabinet-knob\"><b>Classic Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSolid brass construction allows for years of durable continuous use. Available in 7 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Classic Shower Door Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Cover Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Cover  Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 3/8\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 1 classic knob, screw cover and all the hardware for installation on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors, with either a 3/8\" or 1/2\" diameter hole in the glass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Each (1 Knob - for one side of a glass door)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Classic Shower Door Knob",
                "description": "This beautiful large 1-3/4 inch diameter classic style glass shower door knob set is easy to grab and compliment the traditional designed bathroom.  These single knob kit is normally used on sliding glass shower doors but can also be used on one side of a swing glass door. Their solid brass construction allows for years of durable continuous use. Available in 7 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.",
